    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Farcankii Ceesaw",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haddaba kuwanuna waa farcankii Ceesaw, isna waa Edom. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ceesaw wuxuu gabdhihii reer Kancaan ka guursaday Caadah ina Eeloon kii reer Xeed, iyo Aaholiibaamah ina Canah, oo ahayd ina Sibecoon kii reer Xiwi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iyo Basmad oo ahayd ina Ismaaciil, oo la dhalatay Nebayod. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Caadahna waxay Ceesaw u dhashay Elifas, Basmadna waxay u dhashay Recuu'eel; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aaholiibaamahna waxay u dhashay Yecuush, iyo Yaclaam, iyo Qorax; kuwanu waa wiilashii Ceesaw, oo isaga ugu dhashay dalkii Kancaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa Ceesaw kaxaystay naagihiisii, iyo wiilashiisii iyo gabdhihiisii, iyo dadkii gurigiisa oo dhan, iyo lo'diisii, iyo xayawaankiisii oo dhan, iyo wixii uu lahaa oo dhan oo uu ku urursaday dalkii Kancaan; markaasuu tegey dal ka fog walaalkiis Yacquub. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waayo, xoolahoodu aad bay u badnaayeen oo ma ay wada degi karin; dhulkii ay degganaan jireenna ma uu wada qaadi karin lo'dooda aawadeed. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ceesawna wuxuu degay Buur Seciir; Ceesaw waa Edom. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuwanuna waa farcankii Ceesaw oo ahaa reer Edom aabbahood oo degganaan jiray Buur Seciir. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuwanu waa wiilashii Ceesaw magacyadoodii, Elifas oo ahaa wiilkii Caadah oo naagtii Ceesaw ahayd, iyo Recuu'eel oo ahaa wiilkii Basmad oo naagtii Ceesaw ahayd. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wiilashii Elifasna waxay ahaayeen Teemaan, Oomaar, Sefoo, iyo Gactaam iyo Qenas. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Timnac waxay ahayd addoontii uu Elifas ina Ceesaw qabay, oo waxay Elifas u dhashay Camaaleq; kuwanu waa wiilashii naagtii Ceesaw oo Caadah ahayd. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuwanuna waa wiilashii Recuu'eel: Nahad, iyo Serax, iyo Shammah, iyo Misaah; kuwanuna waxay ahaayeen wiilashii naagtii Ceesaw oo Basmad ahayd. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuwanuna waxay ahaayeen wiilashii naagtii Ceesaw oo ahayd Aaholiibaamah, gabadhii Canah oo ahayd ina Sibecoon; oo iyana waxay Ceesaw u dhashay Yacuush, iyo Yaclaam, iyo Qorax. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuwanu waxa weeye ugaasyadii wiilashii Ceesaw. Waa wiilashii Elifas kii ahaa curadkii Ceesaw kuwaas oo ah ugaas Teemaan, iyo ugaas Oomaar, iyo ugaas Sefoo, iyo ugaas Qenas, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ugaas Qorax, iyo ugaas Gactaam, iyo ugaas Camaaleq. Kuwanu waa ugaasyadii Elifas dhalay oo dalkii Edom joogay; kuwanu waa wiilashii Caadah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuwanuna waa wiilashii Recuu'eel oo ahaa ina Ceesaw: ugaas Nahad, iyo ugaas Serax, iyo ugaas Shammah, iyo ugaas Misaah. Kuwanuna waa ugaasyadii uu Recuu'eel dhalay oo dalkii Edom joogay; kuwanu waa wiilashii naagtii Ceesaw oo Basmad ahayd. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuwanuna waa wiilashii naagtii Ceesaw oo Aaholiibaamah ahayd: ugaas Yecuush, iyo ugaas Yaclaam, iyo ugaas Qorax. Kuwanuna waa ugaasyadii ay dhashay naagtii Ceesaw oo ahayd Aaholiibaamah, gabadhii Canah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuwanu waa wiilashii Ceesaw oo ahaa Edom, oo kuwanu waa ugaasyadoodii. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuwanuna waa wiilashii Seciir, kii reer Xor, oo ahaa kuwii dhulka degganaa, Lootaan, iyo Shoobaal, iyo Sibecoon, iyo Canah, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iyo Dishon, iyo Eeser, iyo Diishaan. Kuwanu waa ugaasyadii reer Xor, oo ahaa ilma Seciir oo degganaa dhulkii Edom. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Carruurtii Lootaanna waxay ahaayeen Xori iyo Heemaam, Lootaan walaashiisna waxay ahayd Timnac. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuwanuna waa carruurtii Shoobaal; Calwaan, iyo Maanahad, iyo Ceebaal, iyo Shefo, iyo Oonaam. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuwanuna waa carruurtii Sibecoon; Ayah, iyo Canah. Kanu waa Canah kii cidlada ka helay ilaha biyaha oo kulul, markuu daajinayay dameerrada aabbihiis Sibecoon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuwanuna waa carruurtii Canah; Dishon, iyo Aaholiibaamah, gabadhii Canah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuwanuna waa carruurtii Dishon; Xemdaan, iyo Eshbaan, iyo Yitraan, iyo Keraan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuwanuna waa carruurtii Eeser; Bilhaan, iyo Sacwaan, iyo Caqaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuwanuna waa carruurtii Diishaan; Cuus iyo Araan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuwanuna waa ugaasyadii reer Xor; ugaas Lootaan, iyo ugaas Shoobaal, iyo ugaas Sibecoon, iyo ugaas Canah, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ugaas Dishon, iyo ugaas Eeser, iyo ugaas Diishaan. Kuwanuna waa ugaasyadii reer Xor siday ahaayeen ugaasyadoodii dalka Seciir joogay.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Boqorradii Dalka Edom",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuwanuna waa boqorradii xukumi jiray dalkii Edom intaan boqorna xukumin reer binu Israa'iil. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Belac ina Becoor wuxuu xukumi jiray Edom, magaaladiisii magaceedana waxaa la odhan jiray Dinhaabah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa Belac dhintay, oo waxaa meeshiisii xukumi jiray Yoobaab ina Serax oo reer Bosraah ahaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoobaabna waa dhintay, oo waxaa meeshiisii xukumi jiray Xushaam oo ka yimid dhulkii reer Teemaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Xushaamna waa dhintay, oo waxaa meeshiisii xukumi jiray Hadad ina Bedad, oo reer Midyaan ku laayay berrinkii Moo'aab, magaaladiisii magaceedana waxaa la odhan jiray Cawiid. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa Hadadna dhintay, oo waxaa meeshiisii xukumi jiray Samlah oo reer Masreqah ahaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
