            "sid": "GEN 36:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bacal Xaanaan ina Cakboorna waa dhintay, oo waxaa meeshiisii xukumi jiray Hadar, magaaladiisii magaceedana waxaa la odhan jiray Faacuu; naagtiisa magaceeduna wuxuu ahaa Meheetabeel, oo ay Matreed gabadha Meesaahaab dhashay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
