        {
          "text": "iyo ugaas Magdii'eel, iyo ugaas Ciiraam. Kuwanu waa ugaasyadii reer Edom sidii ay u degganaayeen dhulkii ay lahaayeen. Kanu waa Ceesaw oo ahaa reer Edom aabbahood.",
